</b> built a hut.","x":n:404be3906ac0c1c3,"y":n:403bd358302558c2,},{"id":n:4074b00000000000,"tick":n:40b8fe0000000000,"day":n:4070b00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Embla</b> began drumming under the old tree as the light fades — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Drumming under the old tree at dusk)</i>","custom":s:"c7","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404aaf62547e64e8,"y":n:40324046307ff30e,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4074c00000000000,"tick":n:40b9130000000000,"day":n:4070c00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4074d00000000000,"tick":n:40b9180000000000,"day":n:4070c00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40405a76f2332520,"y":n:40363ed426aae1ea,},{"id":n:4074e00000000000,"tick":n:40b9240000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> taught <b>Halvar</b> the secret of Eira's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:4074f00000000000,"tick":n:40b9280000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Freja</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Ask's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4075000000000000,"tick":n:40b92c0000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's tilling. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:4075100000000000,"tick":n:40b92f0000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Torv</b> began humming by the fire as the light fades — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Humming by the fire at dusk)</i>","custom":s:"c8","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404a838a62fd9a72,"y":n:4031d0a4972f5fe6,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4075200000000000,"tick":n:40b92f0000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Torv</b> does it differently: humming by the fire as the light fades instead of drumming under the old tree as the light fades. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c8",},{"id":n:4075300000000000,"tick":n:40b9340000000000,"day":n:4070e00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4075400000000000,"tick":n:40b9470000000000,"day":n:4070e00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga</b> and <b>Sten</b> have had a child, <b>Ronja</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4033000000000000,"x":n:404ff0865bcbf699,"y":n:40379ad7fc2b6009,"causes":[s:"agent:9",s:"agent:6",],},{"id":n:4075500000000000,"tick":n:40b9580000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Halvar</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:402c000000000000,"x":n:404d800000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:4075600000000000,"tick":n:40b9580000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Vidar</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:404e800000000000,"y":n:4037000000000000,},{"id":n:4075700000000000,"tick":n:40b95d0000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Eira's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4075800000000000,"tick":n:40b9680000000000,"day":n:4071000000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Idun</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404a800000000000,"y":n:403c000000000000,},{"id":n:4075900000000000,"tick":n:40b97a0000000000,"day":n:4071100000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4075a00000000000,"tick":n:40b9920000000000,"day":n:4071200000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🟤 <b>Saga</b> coaxed a soft red metal out of green stone in the kiln — <b>Saga's the soft metal</b> (Copper) has been invented! <i>The first metal — soft, but the door to bronze.</i>","tech":s:"copper","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:4051bcb4742bd2a9,"y":n:4032230e32fdc961,"causes":[s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4075b00000000000,"tick":n:40b9a50000000000,"day":n:4071200000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> tried something with copper and tin — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:4075c00000000000,"tick":n:40b9af0000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Tuva</b> the secret of Eira's the calendar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4075d00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Idun</b> began placing a stone on the grave — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Placing a stone on the grave)</i>","custom":s:"c9","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404ab06ab3ea7b88,"y":n:403c5c5508489715,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4075e00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Idun</b> does it differently: placing a stone on the grave instead of laying flowers on the grave. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c9",},{"id":n:4075f00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b10000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Sten</b> noticed that the yellow metal never dulls and all hands want it. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"goldGleams","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4051f46442ae7396,"y":n:40318b3c437db8f1,},{"id":n:4076000000000000,"tick":n:40b9b50000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔶 <b>Saga</b> poured copper and tin together and woke a hard new metal — <b>Saga's the hard alloy</b> (Bronze) has been invented! <i>The Bronze Age. Tools, blades and bells no stone could match.</i>","tech":s:"bronze","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:4052bfea5cb17ac4,"y":n:4034f1bc152ad117,"causes":[s:"ev:346",s:"ev:68",],},{"id":n:4076100000000000,"tick":n:40b9c00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Kare</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4028000000000000,},{"id":n:4076200000000000,"tick":n:40b9c40000000000,"day":n:4071400000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4076300000000000,"tick":n:40b9d50000000000,"day":n:4071400000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn</b> and <b>Kare</b> have had a child, <b>Sixten</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4034000000000000,"x":n:4048eb76c6e2ba00,"y":n:403367a8d80803d1,"causes":[s:"agent:8",s:"agent:12",],},{"id":n:4076400000000000,"tick":n:40b9e80000000000,"day":n:4071500000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Tuva</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4031000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:4040000000000000,},{"id":n:4076500000000000,"tick":n:40ba080000000000,"day":n:4071600000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:4048e6f2d59f7105,"y":n:4032d23e5b7452f9,},{"id":n:4076600000000000,"tick":n:40ba1b0000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's pigmentwork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4076700000000000,"tick":n:40ba200000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ylva</b> built a hut.","x":n:404bb2ea5b0498d6,"y":n:4040c729db64d98f,},{"id":n:4076800000000000,"tick":n:40ba200000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ylva</b> was known as <b>Ylva the Founder</b>.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404bb2ea5b0498d6,"y":n:4040c729db64d98f,},{"id":n:4076900000000000,"tick":n:40ba200000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"village","txt":s:"🏘️ Three huts have become more — <b>Ylvaholm</b> has been founded! A village born of nothing but cooperation.","village":s:"Ylvaholm","x":n:404bb2ea5b0498d6,"y":n:4040c729db64d98f,"causes":[s:"agent:7",],},{"id":n:4076a00000000000,"tick":n:40ba210000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Alve</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4032000000000000,"x":n:40491b91687ec2d1,"y":n:403ac347207c6a2c,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4076b00000000000,"tick":n:40ba210000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Idun carving a sign into an old tree until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c5",},{"id":n:4076c00000000000,"tick":n:40ba280000000000,"day":n:4071800000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Eira's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4076d00000000000,"tick":n:40ba4e0000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Halvar</b> brings in the harvest from Halvar's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:402c000000000000,"x":n:404d800000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:4076e00000000000,"tick":n:40ba540000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4076f00000000000,"tick":n:40ba560000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's the net. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:4077000000000000,"tick":n:40ba650000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Idun</b> built a hut.","x":n:404bc40602abad44,"y":n:4040fb3c711420ec,},{"id":n:4077100000000000,"tick":n:40ba690000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> tried something with bronze and wood — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:4077200000000000,"tick":n:40ba700000000000,"day":n:4071b00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4077300000000000,"tick":n:40ba800000000000,"day":n:4071b00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Bjorn</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:4046800000000000,"y":n:4036000000000000,},{"id":n:4077400000000000,"tick":n:40ba9e0000000000,"day":n:4071d00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪙 <b>Sten</b> stamped a fixed weight of metal all agreed to trust — <b>Sten's minted money</b> (Coinage) has been invented! <i>Money — value made portable; markets and wealth take shape.</i>","tech":s:"coinage","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404e15055f575847,"y":n:403a3ee2681ea7a9,"causes":[s:"ev:132",s:"ev:77",],},{"id":n:4077500000000000,"tick":n:40baac0000000000,"day":n:4071d00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's clearstone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:4077600000000000,"tick":n:40bac80000000000,"day":n:4071e00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛠️ <b>Saga</b> cast bronze into edges that held far longer than stone — <b>Saga's bronze plough</b> (Bronze tools) has been invented! <i>Faster everything — clearing, tilling, building.</i>","tech":s:"bronzetools","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:40524e01222b23b8,"y":n:403382ac05a87ca0,"causes":[s:"ev:352",],},{"id":n:4077700000000000,"tick":n:40baca0000000000,"day":n:4071f00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Idun</b> and <b>Sten</b> have had a child, <b>Maja</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4035000000000000,"x":n:404c068d1d4350e7,"y":n:403adb03f6ba0cef,"causes":[s:"agent:13",s:"agent:6",],},{"id":n:4077800000000000,"tick":n:40badd0000000000,"day":n:4071f00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare</b> taught <b>Halvar</b> the secret of Eira's the mason. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:4077900000000000,"tick":n:40bae40000000000,"day":n:4072000000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4077a00000000000,"tick":n:40bb000000000000,"day":n:4072100000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Rune the Founder</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404ecc2ed664c286,"y":n:403e7150e5ae0fbc,},{"id":n:4077b00000000000,"tick":n:40bb380000000000,"day":n:4072300000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Kare</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:404a3f1f2