b7e0000000000,"day":n:4072600000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune</b> and <b>Liv</b> have had a child, <b>Loke</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4036000000000000,"x":n:40462ada99c7d1aa,"y":n:403b23d3caf2947b,"causes":[s:"agent:10",s:"agent:5",],},{"id":n:4078400000000000,"tick":n:40bb800000000000,"day":n:4072600000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Saga</b> built a hut.","x":n:4055baec938b62d9,"y":n:4025fcfb722a0490,},{"id":n:4078500000000000,"tick":n:40bb900000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4078600000000000,"tick":n:40bb900000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Liv the Voice of Runestead</b> set out for Ylvaholm. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40449c6470842f50,"y":n:403c448d0d58cdea,},{"id":n:4078700000000000,"tick":n:40bb970000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Signe</b> the secret of Eira's birchbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4078800000000000,"tick":n:40bb9a0000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare</b> and <b>Ylva</b> have had a child, <b>Vera</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4037000000000000,"x":n:404ae025e3f30f53,"y":n:4035b44a433a8921,"causes":[s:"agent:12",s:"agent:7",],},{"id":n:4078900000000000,"tick":n:40bbc50000000000,"day":n:4072900000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Liv the Voice of Runestead</b> reached Ylvaholm. Strangers shared a fire that night.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404a3ee0e0aab067,"y":n:4040a8311d445f6a,},{"id":n:4078a00000000000,"tick":n:40bbf20000000000,"day":n:4072b00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's clearstone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:4078b00000000000,"tick":n:40bc040000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4078c00000000000,"tick":n:40bc060000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Liv</b> worked iron in a coal-hot fire until it took a keener soul — <b>Liv's tempered blade</b> (Steel) has been invented! <i>The hardest working metal — blades, springs, tools that endure.</i>","tech":s:"steel","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404b4b4fbe5eb18b,"y":n:40428cabf7f6816e,"causes":[s:"ev:128",s:"ev:72",],},{"id":n:4078d00000000000,"tick":n:40bc100000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Sixten</b> the secret of Eira's the net. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:4078e00000000000,"tick":n:40bc130000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Loke</b> the secret of Ask's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4078f00000000000,"tick":n:40bc1b0000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Torv's plough. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"metaltools",},{"id":n:4079000000000000,"tick":n:40bc200000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4079100000000000,"tick":n:40bc200000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Rune the Founder</b> set out for Ylvaholm. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404830593d725599,"y":n:40351d62eec14a37,},{"id":n:4079200000000000,"tick":n:40bc280000000000,