oss village lines.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404efc281da44a76,"y":n:40395fded71d5a11,},{"id":n:4079a00000000000,"tick":n:40bcb80000000000,"day":n:4073300000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Otto</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4038000000000000,"x":n:404e000000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:4079b00000000000,"tick":n:40bd000000000000,"day":n:4073600000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Idun</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:40489e5375763dce,"y":n:403b3b232ce8e0a0,"causes":[s:"agent:13",],},{"id":n:4079c00000000000,"tick":n:40bd080000000000,"day":n:4073600000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Eira's clearstone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:4079d00000000000,"tick":n:40bd090000000000,"day":n:4073600000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Signe</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:404799d47f058f5e,"y":n:403a78a8312a0a14,},{"id":n:4079e00000000000,"tick":n:40bd0c0000000000,"day":n:4073700000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⏳ <b>Saga</b> tamed a falling weight into steady, counted time — <b>Saga's the clockwork</b> (Mechanical clock) has been invented! <i>Time itself measured — the first true machine.</i>","tech":s:"clock","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404dd23d7e017934,"y":n:4039af2c2966d8ae,"causes":[s:"ev:374",s:"ev:86",],},{"id":n:4079f00000000000,"tick":n:40bd240000000000,"day":n:4073800000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:407a000000000000,"tick":n:40bd400000000000,"day":n:4073900000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 S