year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Vidar</b> and <b>Freja</b> struck a fair trade across village lines.","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:404de39611abfc32,"y":n:403e81f1349523f4,},{"id":n:407d800000000000,"tick":n:40bf800000000000,"day":n:4075100000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Bjorn</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404b8e70101c29da,"y":n:40369e535f294b29,},{"id":n:407d900000000000,"tick":n:40bfa20000000000,"day":n:4075200000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Otto</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4038000000000000,"x":n:404961136fcddedb,"y":n:4037336e8169f40f,},{"id":n:407da00000000000,"tick":n:40bfa80000000000,"day":n:4075200000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> taught <b>Sixten</b> the secret of Torv's hammercraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"smithing",},{"id":n:407db00000000000,"tick":n:40bfac0000000000,"day":n:4075300000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Tuva</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4031000000000000,},{"id":n:407dc00000000000,"tick":n:40bfad0000000000,"day":n:4075300000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Falk</b> taught <b>Maja</b> the secret of Eira's teaching. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"school",},{"id":n:407dd00000000000,"tick":n:40bfce0000000000,"day":n:4075400000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> tried something with stone and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4031000000000000,},{"id":n:407de00000000000,"tick":n:40bfd50000000000,"day":n:4075400000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> tried something with stone and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4031000000000000,},{"id":n:407df00000000000,"tick":n:40bfd90000000000,"day":n:4075400000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Halvar</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:402c000000000000,},{"id":n:407e000000000000,"tick":n:40bfda0000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Saga</b> noticed that iron worked long in a hotter fire holds a keener edge. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"steelKeen","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404ba93e333ab46f,"y":n:40430e020d37aa86,},{"id":n:407e100000000000,"tick":n:40bfdf0000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Liv's the glass eye. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"optics",},{"id":n:407e200000000000,"tick":n:40bfef0000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Rune</b> began singing by the water as the light fades — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Singing by the water at dusk)</i>","custom":s:"c12","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404aad356b01d119,"y":n:40312121efb33c91,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:407e300000000000,"tick":n:40bfef0000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Rune</b> does it differently: singing by the water as the light fades instead of drumming under the old tree as the light fades. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c12",},{"id":n:407e400000000000,"tick":n:40bff00000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:401c000000000000,},{"id":n:407e500000000000,"tick":n:40bff40000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:407e600000000000,"tick":n:40bff70000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:407e700000000000,"tick":n:40c0048000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Maja</b> taught <b>Falk</b> the secret of Eira's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:407e800000000000,"tick":n:40c00c0000000000,"day":n:4075700000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ronja</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4033000000000000,"x":n:4048000000000000,"y":n:403f000000000000,},{"id":n:407e900000000000,"tick":n:40c00c0000000000,"day":n:4075700000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Sixten</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4034000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:407ea00000000000,"tick":n:40c01e0000000000,"day":n:4075900000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ronja</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4033000000000000,"x":n:40484e7282938381,"y":n:403decd66a6ba75b,},{"id":n:407eb00000000000,"tick":n:40c0208000000000,"day":n:4075900000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Signe</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:4044431849d1658c,"y":n:403accd2e723ae16,"causes":[s:"agent:15",],},{"id":n:407ec00000000000,"tick":n:40c0278000000000,"day":n:4075900000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> tried something with wood and stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:402c000000000000,},{"id":n:407ed00000000000,"tick":n:40c0280000000000,"day":n:4075900000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Halvar</b> built a hut.","x":n:404b0d197bea50f4,"y":n:4035ad282f2b3e88,},{"id":n:407ee00000000000,"tick":n:40c03b0000000000,"day":n:4075b00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Selma</b> noticed that hot sand turns glassy. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sandGlints","agent":n:4039000000000000,"x":n:4053a82baca5ff22,"y":n:404aad77ec3520e3,},{"id":n:407ef00000000000,"tick":n:40c0420000000000,"day":n:4075c00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:407f000000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> died of old age at 81. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404a47d9865eb05f,"y":n:4031cf512b8dd6e0,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:407f100000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Tuva carving a sign into the hut wall until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c10",},{"id":n:407f200000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Embla planting a seed by the grave until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c11",},{"id":n:407f300000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Rune singing by the water as the light fades until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c12",},{"id":n:407f400000000000,"tick":n:40c0570000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Falk</b> the secret of Eira's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:407f500000000000,"tick":n:40c05f0000000000,"day":n:4075e00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Otto</b> the secret of Torv's hammercraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"smithing",},{"id":n:407f600000000000,"tick":n:40c0658000000000,"day":n:4075f00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ronja</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4033000000000000,},{"id":n:407f700000000000,"tick":n:40c06c0000000000,"day":n:4075f00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Otto</b> the secret of Eira's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:407f800000000000,"tick":n:40c0780000000000,"day":n:4076000000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"conversion","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> has left Placing a stone on the grave for Laying flowers on the grave. Minds change; so do worlds.","custom":s:"c6","from":s:"c9",},{"id":n:407f900000000000,"tick":n:40c07b8000000000,"day":n:4076000000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Sixten</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4034000000000000,"x":n:404b305a61c11b3b,"y":n:40382aa6205f8b4b,},{"id":n:407fa00000000000,"tick":n:40c08a0000000000,"day":n:4076200000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:407fb00000000000,"tick":n:40c0938000000000,"day":n:4076200000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:407fc00000000000,"tick":n:40c0980000000000,"day":n:4076300000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:407fd00000000000,"tick":n:40c0980000000000,"day":n:4076300000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Signe</b> walks the last few steps home backward. Always. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:404259f4fa548bda,"y":n:403c672925cc6459,},{"id":n:407fe00000000000,"tick":n:40c0ae8000000000,"day":n:4076500000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Vidar</b> built a hut.","x":n:404afb3e623b396d,"y":n:403d9c27fadab921,},{"id":n:407ff00000000000,"tick":n:40c0b40000000000,"day":n:4076500000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Tuva</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4031000000000000,"x":n:404912da86f608d3,"y":n:403c207f009d6f93,"causes":[s:"agent:17",],},{"id":n:4080000000000000,"tick":n:40c0b80000000000,"day":n:4076500000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🖨️ <b>Liv</b> set movable letters and pressed a page in a heartbeat — <b>Liv's the press</b> (Printing press) has been invented! <i>Knowledge copied a thousandfold — no idea dies again.</i>","tech":s:"printpress","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:4051cde77b8a8bfd,"y":n:4032d9ffd0498b06,"causes":[s:"ev:55",s:"ev:374",],},{"id":n:4080080000000000,"tick":n:40c0c30000000000,"day":n:4076600000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Idun</b> and <b>Rune</b> have had a child, <b>Nanna</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:403b000000000000,"x":n:404a74b1891947e3,"y":n:403094b10e957e9d,"causes":[s:"agent:13",s:"agent:10",],},{"id":n:4080100000000000,"tick":n:40c0c30000000000,"day":n:4076600000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Nanna</b> taught <b>Loke</b> the secret of Eira's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4080180000000000,"tick":n:40c0c60000000000,"day":n:4076700000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Maja</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4035000000000000,"x":n:404ab23320456c23,"y":n:40360df688899f86,},{"id":n:4080200000000000,"tick":n:40c0d20000000000,"day":n:4076800000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4080280000000000,"tick":n:40c0e00000000000,"day":n:4076900000000000,"year":n:404e800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Idun</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404aa96620d08063,"y":n:40323467749002fc,},],"dna":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:404e800000000000,"dna":{"Curious":n:4041000000000000,"Social":n:4041800000000000,"Diligent":n:4040000000000000,},"population":n:4036000000000000,"maxPop":n:4037000000000000,"generations":n:4010000000000000,"knowledgeCount":n:404a000000000000,"knowledgeMax":n:404a800000000000,"villages":[s:"Runestead",s:"Ylvaholm",],"births":n:4037000000000000,"talks":n:4096640000000000,"deaths":{"starvation":n:4000000000000000,"cold":n:0000000000000000,"age":n:4008000000000000,"wolves":n:0000000000000000,},"knowledgeLosses":n:0000000000000000,"rediscoveries":n:0000000000000000,"failedExperiments":n:4066c00000000000,"observations":n:4052800000000000,"customsCount":n:4028000000000000,"traditions":[s:"The Knowing Eye",s:"the Star-Herd",s:"Painting a mark on a flat stone",s:"Planting a seed by the fallen prey",s:"Laying flowers on the grave",],"taboos":[],"beliefs":[s:"The Knowing Eye",s:"the Star-Herd",],"conversions":n:4024000000000000,"hunts":n:0000000000000000,"harshWinters":n:4008000000000000,"reformations":n:0000000000000000,"worldview":s:"empiric","tabooBreaks":n:0000000000000000,"religions":[undef,],"legends":[s:"Ask Ask the Firebringer.",s:"Eira Eira the Spearmaker.",s:"Torv Torv the Ironhand.",s:"Rune Rune the Founder.",s:"Liv Liv the Voice of Runestead.",s:"Ylva Ylva the Founder.",],"milestones":{"⚙️ Storytelling":s:"year 1","⚙️ Fire":s:"year 1","⚙️ Rope":s:"year 1","⚙️ Painting":s:"year 1","⚙️ Weaving":s:"year 1","👶 First child":s:"year 2","⚙️ Music":s:"year 2","⚙️ Sharpened stone":s:"year 4","⚙️ Spear":s:"year 4","⚙️ Axe":s:"year 4","⚙️ Hut":s:"year 4","⚙️ The Wheel":s:"year 4","⚙️ Bow":s:"year 5","⚙️ Pottery":s:"year 5","⚙️ Kiln":s:"year 6","⚙️ Farming":s:"year 6","⚙️ Writing":s:"year 6","⚙️ Granary":s:"year 6","⚙️ Philosophy":s:"year 6","⚙️ Composition":s:"year 6","⚙️ Glass":s:"year 6","⚙️ Brick":s:"year 7","⚙️ Sailing":s:"year 7","⚙️ Well":s:"year 7","⚙️ Tin":s:"year 7","⚙️ Coal":s:"year 8","⚙️ Masonry":s:"year 9","⚙️ Counting":s:"year 9","⚙️ Calendar":s:"year 9","⚙️ Road":s:"year 9","⚙️ Mill":s:"year 9","⚙️ Architecture":s:"year 9","⚙️ Aqueduct":s:"year 10","⚙️ Medicine":s:"year 10","⚙️ Law":s:"year 10","⚙️ Glassblowing":s:"year 10","⚙️ Fishing":s:"year 12","⚙️ School":s:"year 16","⚙️ Scholarship":s:"year 16","⚙️ Iron smithing":s:"year 19","⚙️ Metal tools":s:"year 19","⚙️ Temple":s:"year 23","⚙️ Windmill":s:"year 27","⚙️ Optics":s:"year 31","⚙️ University":s:"year 32","⚙️ Science":s:"year 33","🏘️ First village":s:"year 37","🌿 First tradition":s:"year 38","⚙️ Copper":s:"year 46","⚙️ Bronze":s:"year 46","⚙️ Coinage":s:"year 48","⚙️ Bronze tools":s:"year 48","⚙️ Steel":s:"year 50","⚙️ Mechanical clock":s:"year 52","⚙️ Printing press":s:"year 60",},"status":s:"Alive in year 61","violence":{"steals":n:0000000000000000,"raids":n:0000000000000000,"feuds":n:0000000000000000,"killings":n:0000000000000000,"brawls":n:0000000000000000,"wars":n:0000000000000000,},"trades":n:405d000000000000,"gifts":n:4000000000000000,"leaders":[s:"Runestead: Liv",],"giftWays":[],"wealthTop":s:"Liv the Voice of Runestead (170)",},"history":{"worldName":s:"Runestead","seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:404e800000000000,"intro":s:"This is the chronicle of Runestead - 61 years, 4 generations, written by no one. Every line below happened.","outro":s:"The chronicle is still being written. 22 souls carry it onward.","chapters":[{"title":s:"The Waking","from":n:3ff0000000000000,"to":n:403e000000000000,"text":[s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: Eira, Ask, Embla, Torv. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Eira told the day back as a story worth remembering. Eira's the tale entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Ask rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder. Ask's ember entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 1, when Eira twisted grass fibers into something strong. Eira's cord entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Eira ground coloured earth and left an image on the wall. Eira's pigmentwork entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 1, when Eira crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame. Eira's the loom entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 2, when Eira found that a struck string and a voice could ring together. Eira's melody entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Eira struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard. Eira's knife entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Eira lashed a sharp point to a long shaft. Eira's javelin entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 4, when Eira bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft. Eira's hewer entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 4, when Eira raised logs against each other into a shelter. Eira's shelter entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 4, when Eira watched a log roll and understood something great. Eira's pulley entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 5, when Eira bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back. Eira's birchbow entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 5, when Eira placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone. Eira's urn entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 6, when Eira built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire. Eira's burnoven entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 6, when Eira pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited. Eira's tilling entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 6, when Eira carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner. Eira's script entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 6, when Eira built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring. Eira's grain store entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 6, when Eira asked not what the world is but why, and wrote it down. Eira's the argument entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 6, when Eira wrote music down so a song could outlive its singer. Eira's the score entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 6, when Eira melted sand and found something transparent. Eira's clearstone entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 7, when Eira fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true. Eira's mudbrick entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 7, when Torv stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work. Torv's the boat entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 7, when Eira lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water. Eira's draw-well entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 7, when Eira smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone. Eira's white metal entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 8, when Eira found the black stone burns hotter than any wood. Eira's coalcraft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 9, when Eira dressed and fitted stone so it stood without mortar. Eira's the mason entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 9, when Eira matched pebble to sheep and found number itself. Eira's the count entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 9, when Eira counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days. Eira's the calendar entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 9, when Eira laid stone in a bed so carts ran true in any weather. Eira's trackway entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 9, when Eira let the wheel drive stones that ground grain. Eira's gristmill entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 9, when Eira raised the arch, and space opened under stone. Eira's the vault entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 10, when Eira carried water across the valley on arches of stone. Eira's the channel entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 10, when Eira learned which leaves ease pain and close a wound. Eira's herb-lore entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 10, when Eira wrote the customs down so all were judged by one measure. Eira's the code entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 10, when Eira blew molten sand into clear vessels thin as a bubble. Eira's blown glass entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 12, when Eira let a twisted line sink where the fish gather. Eira's the net entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 16, when Eira set the knowing to teach the young in one place. Eira's teaching entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 16, when Eira gathered writings and studied them as a life's work. Eira's learned study entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 19, when Torv watched gleaming metal run from the glowing ore. Torv's hammercraft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 19, when Torv forged the iron into an edge that never dulled. Torv's plough entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 23, when Eira raised a house for the sacred and gathered the faithful in it. Eira's the shrine-hall entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 27, when Eira set great sails to catch the wind and turn the stones. Eira's the windmill entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 1, Ask began seeing the world differently - believing the world repeats and can be understood. Where others saw spirits, they saw patterns.",s:"In the year 1, Eira began seeing the world differently - believing the lights above are the fires of the first people, still watching. Where others saw patterns, they felt a will behind them.",s:"The winter of year 19 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"From that day on, Ask was known as Ask the Firebringer.",s:"From that day on, Eira was known as Eira the Spearmaker.",s:"From that day on, Torv was known as Torv the Ironhand.",s:"Through it all 9 children were born under its skies and 1 lives ended - 1 to hunger.",],},{"title":s:"The Hunger Winter","from":n:403f000000000000,"to":n:404e000000000000,"text":[s:"The chronicle marks the year 31, when Liv ground clear glass until it bent light to the eye. Liv's the glass eye entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 32, when Liv joined scholars and students into a lasting house of learning. Liv's the academy entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 33, when Liv tested the guess against the world and kept only what held. Liv's the method entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 46, when Saga coaxed a soft red metal out of green stone in the kiln. Saga's the soft metal entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 46, when Saga poured copper and tin together and woke a hard new metal. Saga's the hard alloy entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 48, when Sten stamped a fixed weight of metal all agreed to trust. Sten's minted money entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 48, when Saga cast bronze into edges that held far longer than stone. Saga's bronze plough entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 50, when Liv worked iron in a coal-hot fire until it took a keener soul. Liv's tempered blade entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 52, when Saga tamed a falling weight into steady, counted time. Saga's the clockwork entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 60, when Liv set movable letters and pressed a page in a heartbeat. Liv's the press entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 37, three huts grew into more, and Runestead was founded - a place with a name, which is the beginning of belonging.",s:"In the year 47, three huts grew into more, and Ylvaholm was founded - a place with a name, which is the beginning of belonging.",s:"By the year 38, believing the lights above are the fires of the first people, still watching had become simply what one does in Runestead. No one decided this.",s:"By the year 38, painting a mark on a flat stone when something new is made had become simply what one does in Runestead. It merely became true.",s:"By the year 38, believing the world repeats and can be understood had become simply what one does in Runestead. No council voted.",s:"By the year 38, planting a seed by the fallen prey had become simply what one does in Runestead. It merely became true.",s:"By the year 53, laying flowers on the grave had become simply what one does in Ylvaholm. No one decided this.",s:"The winter of year 35 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The winter of year 57 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"From that day on, Rune was known as Rune the Founder.",s:"From that day on, Liv was known as Liv the Voice of Runestead.",s:"From that day on, Ylva was known as Ylva the Founder.",s:"Rune the Founder reached Runestead. Strangers shared a fire that night. So it has always gone: ideas travel on foot.",s:"The chronicle notes, without explanation, that Signe walks the last few steps home backward. Always. Once begun, never stopped.",s:"In Runestead, the people have begun to listen when Liv speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"And each harvest-turn, those with surplus laid a share at the leader's door. So standing became wealth, and wealth standing.",s:"One soul, that age, quietly left an old way for a new one.",s:"In these years 14 children were born under its skies and 4 lives ended - 3 to age, 1 to hunger.",],},],},"endState":{"tick":n:40c0e00000000000,"hour":n:4018000000000000,"day":n:4076900000000000,"season":s:"spring","ended":false,"endedYear":undef,"maxPop":n:4037000000000000,"nextId":n:403c000000000000,"nextCustomId":n:402a000000000000,"nextAnimalId":n:4058800000000000,"maxGeneration":n:4010000000000000,"usedNames":n:403b000000000000